    "body": "Rather than nesting the profile look up here maybe it would be better to iterate through a list of env vars using a find_map, something like\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nlet profile_env_vars = vec![\"AWSU_PROFILE\", \"AWS_VAULT\", \"AWS_PROFILE\"];  \r\nlet profile = profile_env_vars.iter().find_map(|env_var| context.get_env(env_var));\r\n```",
